c\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Gold_Pile_Single_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;(1x)\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-left: 20px\">\n<b>Properties</b><div class=\"bg3wiki-horizontlist\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1           gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.001 kg (0.002 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.001 kg (0.002 lb)</li></ul>\n</div> \n</div> \n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Perform\" title=\"Perform\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/20px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/30px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/40px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Performer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp/20px-Perform_Violin_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Perform_Violin_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Perform\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Perform\">Performer</a> makes a <a href=\"/wiki/Performance\" title=\"Performance\">Performance</a> check to determine the quality of the performance. Most audience members use this action to tip the performers if the check is successful, but a successful performance does not necessarily result <i>every</i> attendee tipping the performers.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Difficulty Class\">Difficulty Class</a> of this check scales with the size of the audience:\n<ul><li>1 audience member: DC 10</li>\n<li>2-3 audience members: DC 12</l